@CapitecDisputes.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-a-token-from-the-DevTokenGenerator-test

### List every dispute
GET {{CapitecDisputes.Api_HostAddress}}/api/disputes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List only the disputes that are still initiated
GET {{CapitecDisputes.Api_HostAddress}}/api/disputes?status=Initiated
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Open the seeded initiated dispute
GET {{CapitecDisputes.Api_HostAddress}}/api/disputes/0199c0de-0001-7000-8000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Raise a dispute
POST {{CapitecDisputes.Api_HostAddress}}/api/disputes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "0199c0de-1001-7000-8000-000000000009",
  "transactionAmount": 249.95,
  "transactionCurrency": "ZAR",
  "transactionDate": "2026-10-20T10:05:00+00:00",
  "merchantName": "Checkers Sixty60",
  "reason": "Delivered order was missing three items."
}

### Move the seeded initiated dispute to under investigation
PATCH {{CapitecDisputes.Api_HostAddress}}/api/disputes/0199c0de-0001-7000-8000-000000000001/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "UnderInvestigation"
}
